        "edit": "Removed the duplicate 3'd6 case item (which caused a case-item conflict) and cleaned up the stray blank lines in the always block; the case now uniquely maps 3'd0->X=0,Y=1, 3'd5/3'd6->X=1,Y=0, default->X=0,Y=0.",
